od on every instruction.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Replace all DIV, DIVU, REM, and REMU combinational operators with one\\nshared radix-4 unsigned restoring divider that resolves two quotient bits\\nper cycle, at most 16 iterations. Convert signed operands to magnitudes\\non launch and correct quotient/remainder signs on completion. Handle\\ndivide-by-zero\n…[7543 of 10615 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:9b9f93dc75dd17ec]…\n bus stalls, and redirects without dropping or duplicating instructions.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/alu.sv\", \"description\": \"Parameterize combinational DIV/REM so standalone ALU tests retain it, while the production core constant-disables it; preserve ALTOPS formulas.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 101.08, \"delta_pct\": 733.99, \"vs_baseline\": 733.99, \"fmax_mhz\": 45.399, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4491485, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2830, \"ff\": 662, \"seeds\": [46.017, 45.399, 45.399], \"perturbations\": [[0, 46.017, 21], [1, 45.399, 20], [2, 45.399, 20]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs1_val_0_s100\", \"slack_ns\": -16.731, \"arrival_ns\": 27.025, \"logic_cells\": 44, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_hazard\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 21, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-29T18:15:51.001126Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 1}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
